    "body": "When users leave the platform they often want to make sure that their personal information is wiped. We should add a button under settings to allow them to remove their private information and close their account so we do not have to do it manually.\r\n\r\n- [x] Add a link in settings\r\n- [x] Create a page for account deletion\r\n- [x] Ask the user for feedback\r\n- [x] Suggest that the user download their data before they delete their account\r\n- [x] Remove: email, password, username, birth date, area code (from weather)",
